  "review_md": "## Verdict: approve\n\nThe implementation returns a slice of the full matching result list and stores full results in the query cache. It satisfies the issue and maintainer clarification; no important findings.\n\n### Hypotheses tested\n\n- Result order and first-match selection: probe passed.\n- Cache behavior in both limited/unlimited call orders: probe passed.\n- Zero and negative limits: probe passed.\n- Named-table behavior: probe passed.\n\n### Checks run\n\n- `python -m pytest -q` — 236 passed.\n- `python /home/runner/work/_temp/review-probes/probe_issue4.py` — passed for order, cache call order, zero, negative, and named table."
